    "reviewCount": 2,
    "photoCount": 21,
    "rating": 5,
    "timeAgo": "May 28, 2025",
    "text": "Incredible Results from Pressure Washing Experts – Highly Recommend! We recently hired Pressure Washing Experts, and Authur was our technician. He did an outstanding job on multiple areas around our home—our driveway, front porch, paver walkway on the side of the house, patio, extended custom paver patio, and especially our pergola. The pergola was the most dramatic transformation. It had been heavily covered in algae and buildup from a nearby dogwood tree that we recently removed. We truly thought it was beyond saving, but Authur brought it back to life—it looks brand new and completely refreshed! What’s even more impressive is that the service was completed during scattered showers in the area, and yet the results are already incredible. We’ll be back to leave another review once everything has completely dried—but we couldn’t wait to share how pleased we are so far. Authur was professional, meticulous, and extremely courteous throughout the process. The before and after photos speak for themselves—see attached! If you're in the Paulding or Dallas, GA area, do yourself a favor and book with Pressure Washing Experts. The results are top-notch, and the service is even better! \"+18\"",
    "serviceCategory": "decks-patios",
    "serviceLabel": "Deck & Patio Cleaning",
